@startuml HU01_Autenticacion_Web3
title HU-01 — Autenticación Web3\nRefactorización DIP + Singleton (Sprint 1 · DeFi360)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1

actor       "Usuario"             as User
participant "AuthController"      as AC
participant "<<interface>>\nIWalletConnector" as IWC
participant "MockWalletConnectorImpl" as MWC
participant "DatabaseConnection\n<<Singleton>>" as DBC
database    "PostgreSQL"          as DB

autonumber

note over AC, IWC
  T-01: AuthController depende de IWalletConnector (DIP).
  No instancia MockWallet directamente.
end note

User -> AC : POST /auth/connect\n{ walletAddress }

AC -> IWC : connect(walletAddress)
note right of AC
  Constructor Injection:
  AuthController(IWalletConnector connector)
end note

IWC -> MWC : connect(walletAddress)
activate MWC

alt walletAddress válida
    MWC --> IWC : WalletSession { address, token }
    IWC --> AC  : WalletSession

    AC -> DBC : getInstance()
    note right of DBC
      T-02: Singleton garantiza
      una única conexión a DB.
    end note
    activate DBC
    DBC --> AC : Connection (única instancia)

    AC -> DB : INSERT sesion (address, token, timestamp)
    DB --> AC : OK

    deactivate DBC
    AC --> User : 200 OK { sessionToken }

else walletAddress inválida
    MWC --> IWC : throw InvalidWalletException
    IWC --> AC  : InvalidWalletException
    deactivate MWC
    AC --> User : 401 Unauthorized { error: "Wallet inválida" }

else sesión duplicada
    MWC --> IWC : throw DuplicateSessionException
    IWC --> AC  : DuplicateSessionException
    AC --> User : 409 Conflict { error: "Sesión ya activa" }
end

note over User, DB
  T-03 (QA): Pruebas unitarias cubren los 3 escenarios (conexión exitosa,
  wallet inválida, sesión duplicada) usando mock de IWalletConnector.
  Cobertura mínima requerida: 80%.
end note

@enduml
